; Integration by parts, the shape the math example's deep lane uses: a `rewrite`
; whose states grow as the rule is applied again.
(datatype Math (Mul Math Math) (Integral Math Math) (Sub Math Math) (Diff Math Math))
(rewrite (Integral (Mul a b) x)
         (Sub (Mul a (Integral b x))
              (Integral (Mul (Diff x a) (Integral b x)) x))
         :name "parts")
